I don't see a RELATED,ESTABLISHED rule in your INPUT chain. I'm not sure
why but I once had a similar problem with SSH when there was no -m state
--state RELATED,ESTABLISHED rule at the top of the chain. I would hit
the login prompt and it would take several seconds before the password
prompt appeared. After adding the rule the problem went away.

Someone else may be able to explain why but try that first.

Derick Anderson

